  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "Dilution",
      "excerpt": "DILUTION The Class A ordinary\nshares to be sold by the Selling Securityholders pursuant to this prospectus are currently issued and outstanding. Accordingly, there\nwill be no dilution to our existing shareholders as a result of this offering. The following disclosure and table show the dilution that\nour public shareholders experienced in connection with our initial public offering. The difference between\nthe public offering price per Class A ordinary share in our initial public offering, assuming no value is attributed to the warrants\nincluded in the units we offered in the initial public offering or the private placement warrants, and the net tangible book value (NTBV)\nper Class A ordinary share after the initial public offering constituted the dilution to investors in the initial public offering. Such\ncalculation does not reflect any dilution associated with the sale and exercise of wa",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    }
  ],
